---
import ChapterLayout from '../../../layouts/ChapterLayout.astro';
import { getDrakeChapter } from '../../../data/story/drakeChaptersData';
import { processDrakeContentHtml } from '../../../utils/drakeContentProcessor';

const chapter = getDrakeChapter('013-light', 'chapter-9')!;

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;

const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Chapter 9, the penultimate quest, and I'm sure you know who's turn it is.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Mouse_Trapped\">The Mouse Trapped</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Mouse Trapped\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_18?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Mouse Trapped\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Say hi to our latest hero.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>PLAYABLE CHARACTER - <b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Bartz_Klauser_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Bartz Klauser (Dissidia PSP)\">Bartz</a></b>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/9/94/DissidiaBartz.png/revision/latest?cb=20101216073841\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DissidiaBartz\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/9/94/DissidiaBartz.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/175?cb=20101216073841\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"175\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DissidiaBartz.png\" data-image-key=\"DissidiaBartz.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Ah, Bartz. FF5 is an interesting game, the only things people know it for are Gilgamesh and the awesome Job system. But it never had anything really resembling a coherent three-act plot with any sort of even flow to events, or anything resembling deep and memorable characters. The Japanese developers apparently agree because Bartz's story is completely bland, he's a happy-go-lucky guy who loves adventure, but he's a bit of a dummy and a little cowardly at times. The moral lessons he learns from his story is to not run from your enemies...even if it is you against innumerable odds. At least that's the only lesson I ever saw him learn, and it makes no sense, but why break a streak of nonsensical aesops?\n</p><p>Bartz's fighting style is pretty lame too. He's a Mime, so he doesn't use any attacks of his own, he takes attacks from other characters and combines them to make his own, like charging forward with Cloud's Climhazzard, then punching the opponent away like Tifa's Beat Rush. In that regard though his moves kinda suck, he has a handful of close-range moves and a few slow long-range moves, and his HP attacks are likewise, he has four, melee and long-range. So, much like Yuna, Bartz suffers from an extreme lack of reliable moves that makes him, to me, rather un-fun to play as. He's not weak, his moves do pack a good punch to them comparable to Squall or Cloud, but he's just boring to play as, for me at least. His moves have the unique property of possessing support skills, in the end-game he'll learn stronger versions of those abilities for himself, or can have equipment to provide those boosts, but they're still nice add-ons, and some stack with the innate ability for a higher boost than normal characters can get.\n</p><p>Bartz begins with Blade Crash, a two-hit sweep with Lightning's Gunblade, stepping forward slightly, then he slashes past the opponent like Vaan's Katana and begins a Chase. His Reel Impulse throws an axe like Firion's Reel Axe, but then he jumps up and attacks to wall rush them with Zidane's Mage Mashers. For aerial moves he has Rush Impact, where he slashes twice with Kain's lance as in Lance Barrage, then slams the opponent down like Lightning's Smite. His other aerial starting move is Holy, which works just like Terra's but sucks. No, really, it has weaker homing and speed. His HP attacks are Yuna's Hellfire and Laguna's Ragnarok Blade, which work just like the originals.\n</p><p>As I've said so often, Bartz is fine for his own story but I dislike using him in later stories due to his limited moveset and lame non-melee moves.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>I bought some new armor for Bartz, an Enyo's Breastplate just because I was getting tired of always using that Silken Shirt. Also an economical purchase, everyone except Cecil and Terra can equip it, and in the original six 012 heroes, all but Yuna and Kain. I traded in two Dusty Elixirs to get the Bangaa Tooth needed. So he's got the Chakram, Sakura, Green Beret, Enyo's Breastplate, and the typical accessories - Hyper Ring, Muscle Belt, Sunrise, HP 100%, Level 1-9. Bartz won't have an Assist for some time so give him Empty Assist Gauge.\n</p><p>As the story begins, Bartz hides from Kuja and Kefka as they come looking for him and begins looking around while he's here.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ephemeral Summoner\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Summoner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"><img alt=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ac/D012_Emblem_Red.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050655\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Physical attacks deal 0 damage\"><img alt=\"Physical attacks deal 0 damage\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Red.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Red.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ac/D012_Emblem_Red.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050655\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Straight, Jump or Multichain, take your pick. I have none of the above. Straight Chain is good at E2, while the Jump Chain can go at D1 and the Multichain at D4. The KP Chance is a 90 second win.\n</p><p>First, a Fallacious Wanderer with Holy and Dark Flame. Next, a Fleeting Flash with Launch, Smite and Aerora. Third is an Ephemeral Summoner with Heavenly Strike, Meteor Strike, and the Moogle summon. The Moogle summon randomly copies the effect of any other summon in the game, so who knows what'll happen, it could be useless, could work to your benefit, could swing the entire flow of the match around. The Summoner also has the accessory gimmick of the chapter, and it's a pretty good one. They have a Force to Courage with a Pearl Necklace, Attractorb, and Near Loss. Thus when you have enough Bravery to kill them, they get a 17x booster to absorb EX Force in a wide area and get more energy from it, and Force to Courage then converts the absorbed EX into Bravery. So be careful when they're in the throws of death because suddenly they'll rapidly be gaining Bravery until you finish them off. On the up side it means they won't be able to use EX Mode, but their absorption range of EX Force means you probably won't be getting any for yourself\n</p><p>As we escape the gateway we see the Emperor and Ultimecia speaking to Sephiroth. They're trying to cut him in on some sort of plan, but he rejects them. Bartz gets caught spying and takes off, the Emperor electing to send someone after him instead of doing it himself. Ultimecia suggests Exdeath, and why not, has he done much anything else so far this cycle aside from laugh at Golbez and have Cecil kick his ass?\n</p><p>On the world map turn around and go back to find an Imaginary Champion. Bartz's map attack is Hazard Raid, which as I said is like Cloud's Climhazzard but with Tifa's Beat Rush three-hit combo after the charge. Thus like Firion and Zidane before him Bartz can exploit his range to get the drop on enemies easier than other character. On the island past it is a Blind skill, in battle it limits the actions enemies can take, but I've never used it because how often do enemies act anyway, really? Play this game and take a shot for every time they stand there and let you hit them with the battle-ending HP strike. Now grind down to the mainland and go past the ruined town to find a Rafflesia Vine.\n</p><p>Now, let's have a talk about Chain skills. As I'm sure you've noticed, those random skills you get from the orbs of the dead more often than not are Jump Chains and Round Chains. I'm low on Chain skills myself so we're gonna go get some. The fastest way to handle this is to just launch The prologue of Treachery of the Gods, there are four orbs to shatter on the overworld, do so, get your skill, quit the story and start it over. But this may take too long for your tastes. Well, if we're gonna \"cheat\" by getting skills from other stories, let's do it right.\n</p><p>To get good skills, launch Laguna's story and fight two enemies to leave his first gateway, then proceed over the overworld map to the next gateway where a moogle awaits. I was low on KP so I bought a Cross Chain and used my last KP Gambler in the next gateway to win 106 KP. Just be sure to adjust Laguna to level 6 so your winnings aren't penalized - but even if you don't, he's at Level 24 in my story, so we just only get 80 KP, still plenty when it comes to buying skills. Meeting the 90 second victory KP Chance is easy with all the powered-up equipment you have now, not to mention summons. When the gateway is done, buy two Multichains, then save and leave the story. If you need skills later in Bartz's story or in the next one, you can always exit their story, come back here, buy what you need then dive back in.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"1992 gil\"><img alt=\"1992 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"><img alt=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Blue Drop\"><img alt=\"Blue Drop\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Brawler\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Brawler\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Tree\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Tree\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204000919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Knight\"><img alt=\"Delusory Knight\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Strange Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20110204000919\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest?cb=20100712153022\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phoenix (AUTO)\"><img alt=\"Phoenix (AUTO)\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Summonstone.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Summonstone.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20100712153022\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>No, you aren't seeing things, there's a Party Piece here, meaning Bartz is gonna have to fight them alone. Not a major problem really, it just means more enemies to chain to me. Multichain to get them all and escape with 25 KP. The bonus line is 7 and the KP Chance is a 60 second Break, a snap to complete.\n</p><p>First, an Imaginary Brawler with Water Kick, Elbow Smash and Meteor Strike. Next, a Fallacious Tree with Black Hole, Vacuum Wave, and Almagest. The Strange enemy is a Delusory Knight, and he's a lot more dangerous than past ones. He doesn't come into battle with 1 HP, he has 53 HP. Why does this matter? He has an Iifa Leaf to use Last Chance, so it's gonna take two hits to take him out. He also has a Bravery boost, naturally, the Mandragora summon, a full EX Gauge, and a lot of HP attacks - Dark Flame, Souleater, Paladin Force and Saint's Fall. Breaking him will be difficult, the only way is to wait out Mandragora and strike in the few seconds left before time runs out, or to hit him with Blade Smash and summon Cactuar in the middle of the blow so he Breaks before Mandragora can save him.\n</p><p>The Party piece consists of an Imaginary Champion with Transience, and a Fallacious Tree with Vacuum Wave and Almagest. The two both have the Moogle summon and the Force to Courage set-up.\n</p><p>Bartz hit Level 4 during this gateway and learned Hazard Raid.\n</p><p>The new summonstone is Phoenix, it grants us Reraise, automatically restoring us to our base Bravery when we get Broken for a period of time. The chests have 1992 gil and a Blue Drop.\n</p><p>As we leave, Bartz sees a Crystal and heads off to grab it. Exdeath intercepts but, but given that he moves at the speed of tree Bartz just dodges his attack, dives behind him to get the Crystal and runs off before he can stop him. But of course it's Kuja's trap, and there's someone observing the goings-on not content to let them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Escape\">The Escape</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Escape\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_18?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Escape\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\