Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phantasmal Girl\"><img alt=\"Phantasmal Girl\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Warlock\"><img alt=\"Delusory Warlock\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>On the world map go left to get an EX Charge, then follow the path to a blue gateway. Down the right path is a Delusory Warlock with Rising Wave and Gravity System. Then head inside the blue gateway.\n</p><p>Multichain at C3 to get all six enemies, the Party piece being three. I used an EX Charge here, we have three, why not? And the EX Revenge ability helped a lot with the Party enemies, they're tricky ones. The KP Chance is a 90 second win. If you somehow have a KP Gambler I don't, this is the place to use it.\n</p><p>First is a Fallacious Tree with Vacuum Wave and Almagest. Second comes a Delusory Warlock with Rising Wave and Genesis Rock. Be careful, Genesis Rock is intensely hard to avoid in Pandaemonium. Third is a Phantasmal Girl with Blizzara, Flood, Moogle summon, and Force to Courage gear.\n</p><p>Now of course it's the Party piece. They're all Strange, and use the same set-up as the Delusory Knife with a little less than 1 HP, an Iifa Leaf, Mandragora and a full EX Gauge. The first one is an Imaginary Soldier with Slashing Blow and Omnislash Version 5, with the EX Mode critical rate it will hurt a lot so watch it carefully reading to block. Next is an Imitation Liegeman with Weaponsmaster. The third one is a Delusory Knight with Dark Flame and Paladin Force. With my EX Gauge charged up, I didn't use EX Mode, rather I saved it to EX Revenge and halt their attacks if needed.\n</p><p>The spoils are an awesome 36 KP, and the chest which has another piece of Gold.\n</p><p>Well, let's leave and head to the next red gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/86/DFF_Chaos_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235702\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Golbez\"><img alt=\"Golbez\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chaos Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chaos_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/86/DFF_Chaos_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/36?cb=20110203235702\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Thief\"><img alt=\"Capricious Thief\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV Boost for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV Boost for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Liegeman\"><img alt=\"Imitation Liegeman\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Does this place look familiar? It should. Jump Chain at C3 or Multichain at D3 to get all enemies here. I didn't have either so I quickly swung over to Laguna's story and got a Jump Chain. All the two options affect is which emblem you use, the Initial BRV Boost one that affects both, or the Booster x5 emblem. It's up to you. The bonus line is 9 and the KP Chance is a 90 second win. Also note some of the Hard enemies around this time begin using Level 30 weapons again. You should also aim for that EX Gauge filling up for the boss, or you can just use an EX Charge, it's up to you.\n</p><p>I dealt with the Party piece first. First is a Capricious Reaper with Burst Energy and Snatch Shot, then comes a Fallacious Tree with Black Hole, Vacuum Wave, the Force to Courage gear, and Moogle. The rank and file foes are a Capricious Thief with Scoop Art and Solution 9, a Fallacious Wanderer with Holy, Dark Flame, Force to Courage, and Moogle, and an Imitation Liegeman with Reel Axe, all of Firion's spells, Straightarrow, Force to Courage, and Moogle. The opposition is a little tougher than normal with their accessories and Level 30 weapons, but the Bravery boost from the purple emblem made things easy since I came into battle just a few hundred Bravery shy of enough to kill them. If only they weren't still so stupid...\n</p><p>Bartz hit Level 9 during this time and learned Dark Flame, which works just like Cecil's version.\n</p><p>Head to the end piece. As Bartz continues looking for a way out, he runs into Golbez. Golbez tries to warn that the Crystals can't be found by just looking for them, but Bartz, being Bartz, thinks he's just trying to confuse him and doesn't pay attention. Golbez, presumably in a bad mood for no given reason, then attacks us.\n</p>\n<table style=\"width: 275px; D012 article-table; text-align: center; color:black; float:right\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"font-size: larger; background:#1E90FF\" colspan=\"6\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Boss</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\"><b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Golbez_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Golbez (Dissidia PSP)\">Golbez</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/67/GolbezDissidiaRender.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20101208012650\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GolbezDissidiaRender\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"168\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GolbezDissidiaRender.PNG\" data-image-key=\"GolbezDissidiaRender.PNG\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/67/GolbezDissidiaRender.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20101208012650\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>HP</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Level</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Bravery</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">3,101\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">20\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">257\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"6\"><b>Brave Attacks</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"6\">Attack Force, Rising Wave, Glare Hand, Gravity System, Float System, Gravity Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"6\"><b>HP Attacks</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"6\">Nightglow, Genesis Rock, Cosmic Ray\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"><b>Summon</b>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><b>Difficulty</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"3\">Odin\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">1/5\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Golbez has one of the dumbest builds of any boss since Ultimecia and her trio of Cursed Rings. He has a Hyper Ring with seven HP = 100% boosters, and thus his build will drop to useless the second he takes a single point of HP damage. He's also got Odin to strike us with Break at a 50% success rate, but it's the Auto version so it only appears once he's at low HP, and since we'll probably be ending this fight with an EX Burst as per tradition, Breaking him in the process, Odin is useless because summons can't be triggered during a Burst. \n</p><p>As a result of the above, Golbez is a pretty lame boss. They tried to make him tough, but it fails. He has the same attacks as always so the same strategies as always will carry you through to victory, he seems a little smarter than usual, but is still an idiot. The problem is that unless the extra damage from completing the attack will Break me, or if you've got an Assist to combo with, I don't get why you would never not want to use HP links, doing HP damage is always better than doing Bravery damage, and if you're inflicted with Break an HP attack will cure it. The AI never got this concept and thus Golbez doesn't abuse his four HP links like he should. And Gravity System, well, the AI never got the idea that it's ridiculously easy to counter, either.\n</p><p>Well, gotta fill up this empty space next to that big boss template, let's chat about Bartz's EX Mode. He masters his Mime job, gaining a longer red cape and three golden stars over his head as in FF5. His EX Mode bonus is disappointing though, it's the <a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Goblin_Punch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Goblin Punch\">Goblin Punch</a> attack. Pressing R and Square will use it, it's a combo of hits to do Bravery damage and then launch the opponent away, it has low range but very fast execution. The reason it's lame is because the Bravery damage it does is pathetic normally. The true power of Goblin Punch is that when used on an enemy with the same level as Bartz, its Bravery damage increases eightfold, and suddenly it does as much Bravery damage as Bartz's Bravery combos. Awesome yes, but outside of player-versus-player matches, how often will Bartz and his opponent be at the same level? Even in the end game when he's Level 100, enemies go past that. Bartz's EX Burst is a little tricky and needs good reflexes, you have to press three pairs of directional pad commands as they appear to have him bombard opponents with eight magic-empowered slashes, before he combines his weapons into his own Brave Blade and delivers the final strike.\n</p><p>With the Badass in Black beaten again, he gives more ambiguous advice before there's an earthquake and Bartz takes off while Golbez is distracted. Maybe he should have just come out and <i>told</i> Bartz the Crystal is a trap, but that might make too much sense. We also get an odd scene of Golbez and Exdeath, Exdeath hints Golbez is gunning to get his own Crystal, but nothing ever comes of this, a pity too.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Salvation\">Salvation</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Salvation\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_18?action=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Salvation\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Back on the world map follow the path to find the Teleport Stone! The island over the grindbar has a Maser Eye, get it, grab the four orbs for the chain skill of course, and teleport to the other stone. There's another gateway already.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Tree\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Tree\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Thief\"><img alt=\"Capricious Thief\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Jump Chain at C4 or Multichain at A5. I used the Multichain, don't worry there's a Moogle in the next area. I also used one of my EX Charges, why not? They're just taking up space otherwise. The bonus line is 11 and the KP Chance is a 90 second win.\n</p><p>First up, a Capricious Thief with Shift Break. Next, a Fallacious Tree with Black Hole, Vacuum Wave, Almagest, Moogle and the Force to Courage set-up. Now comes the Party piece and the three enemies that make it up. The first is a Phantasmal Girl with Fire, Blizzara and Flood. Second, an Imitation Liegeman with Reel Axe, the spells, Straightarrow, Force to Courage, Moogle, and an unknown Assist. The final foe is a Fallacious Wanderer with Holy, Moogle, Force to Courage, and a mystery Assist of his own.\n</p><p>As we leave, we get the other side of the reunion in Zidane's tale. Zidane vanishes as he tries to touch Bartz's Crystal, and Exdeath reveals it was a fake he made from the Void to help out Kuja's plan. Now with Zidane in Kuja's clutches, he can deal with Bartz and Squall...or he could except they run away! NO! Exdeath's one weakness - running away at a light jog! He'll never catch up to them now! Damn brats! Hey I'm serious, you've fought him, what is he supposed to do now, by the time he gets over the island grindbars outside Bartz and Squall can be halfway back to Cosmos.\n</p><p>Now we have to find Zidane, so it's time to head back to the Land of Discord to look for him. Kinda deflates the build-up in the 012 story, how the heroes now just stroll in and out of Chaos's domain like a corner store, huh? First grind over to the mainland, there's a chest with 3000 gil near the sealed gateway, and a Moogle to visit. Buy a Multichain and head into the gateway for the what, fifth, sixth time? We should be earning frequent customer points.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial Stage BRV Boost\"><img alt=\"Initial Stage BRV Boost\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-